      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T16:41:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Is the TODO(b/199259751) references below accurate?  The bug seems to be asking for the clients\u0027 CID, not to provide the clients CID.\n\nYes, I think so. The reason we\u0027re passing the CID to VS here is that VS doesn\u0027t currently have any way to determine the CID from its vsock. b/199259751 is asking for a mechanism to allow a server to determine the CID of the caller in a binder call; once that exists VS can use it and this parameter can be deleted. (And should be, since there\u0027s no way to trust it.)",
      "parentUuid": "1ba7e18e_53ee1f79",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 94,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 94,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "0c2bd9bc6672f69e7646cc14337f8c666ef34c67",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
