      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T17:02:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, I see. \n\nI think you\u0027re right.\n\nAll the other notify* functions take a CID, but it\u0027s redundant for this one - assuming that notifyPayloadReady always arrives after notifyPayloadStarted, which I\u0027m not convinced is entirely guaranteed. But then, as you say, I could just call getCid anyway.\n\nI was a bit worried that VS might need the CID to route the notification to the right client, but that doesn\u0027t seem to be true.\n\nThanks!",
      "parentUuid": "7ed96759_660c76af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 94,
        "startChar": 40,
